  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the World Bank and the International Finance Corporation (IFC) for business advisory services to small and medium enterprises, financial sector development and public private partnerships in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the World Bank and the International Finance Corporation (IFC) for business advisory services to small and medium enterprises, financial sector development and public private partnerships in Zimbabwe is a component of Zimbabwe Business Enabling Environment Programme (BEEP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;616,000. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Financial policy and administrative management, Privatisation, Education/training in banking and financial services, Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
